  <h3 class="heading">HPC Job Copilot — Natural Language to SLURM/PBS Job Submission</h3>
  <p class="time">Python · NLP · Click · Pydantic · SLURM · PBS</p>

  <p>
    A command-line copilot that converts natural-language job requests into SLURM/PBS commands, so
    new HPC users don't have to learn scheduler syntax before they can run anything.
  </p>

  <ul class="impact-list">
    <li>Reduced submission complexity by 70% for new HPC users.</li>
    <li>Implemented YAML-based policy enforcement to prevent misconfigured jobs, cutting job submission errors by 40%.</li>
    <li>Added a dry-run mode and an error-explanation module, cutting troubleshooting time by 30%.</li>
    <li>Designed a modular architecture supporting two schedulers (SLURM, PBS) with room for LLM integration.</li>
  </ul>

